{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884140/extras/Main.png?t=1644512139\" /><br>You have been summoned to an unknown castle.<br>And you will receive one mission. <br>Gather various voice data and approach the truth.<br>And you have to delete the root node of the network metabus that is connected to all that truth.<br>In that &quot;Dungeon Castle&quot; where you are.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventure</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884140/extras/Adventure.gif?t=1644512139\" /><br><strong>&quot;You have to get through the Dungeon Castle with a torch and a weapon&quot;</strong><br>Where you are hidden in the dark, light up your way with torches, and defeat enemies who threaten you with weapons and move forward.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Action &amp; battle.</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884140/extras/Action.gif?t=1644512139\" /><br><strong>&quot;The enemies you will meet are powerful&quot;</strong><br>If you are attacked, you will be in a very dangerous state.<br>Also, enemies can ignore your attack.<br>That's why always aim behind your enemies.<br>And try to avoid enemy attacks as much as possible.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Growth</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884140/extras/Growth.gif?t=1644512139\" /><br><strong>&quot;The torches, weapons, and abilities given to you can be stronger&quot;</strong><br>Various weapons, attributes, and new abilities are essential for you to get through the dungeon.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Another dungeon</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884140/extras/CastleImage.png?t=1644512139\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884140/extras/HallImage.png?t=1644512139\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884140/extras/UnderpassImage.png?t=1644512139\" /><br><strong>&quot;There are other dungeons in the Dungeon Castle&quot;</strong><br>You have to clear different dungeons to get a variety of voice data. <br>Don't hesitate to try.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Characteristics of games</h2><br>- The fun of exploring and exploring dark castles.<br>- A strong sense of hitting and exhilarating combat action stand out.<br>- Nine weapons, 20 combat animations, and various abilities.<br>- Interesting main story and sub story.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Enter the Maze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1884140/cd2c6bb309757a73b53ae8911fd9688baf1bc2e0.jpg"},{"name":"Clear the Maze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1884140/249736c419ca7f817b1f3eda15d4653225e6a3b6.jpg"},{"name":"Enter the Hall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1884140/06ec2619c091d53329d54dc519677908dcf6970a.jpg"},{"name":"Clear the Hall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1884140/e82c90f4124618a82bad0fe2e7ddcb9b6371b2ed.jpg"},{"name":"Enter the Underpass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1884140/7352170e4e17795c11d5b6549ca293b013cd4b62.jpg"},{"name":"Clear the Underpass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1884140/b46e9986e933e0f95bd491ab8e8c0e07b00b3175.jpg"},{"name":"Researcher VoiceData On","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1884140/8ff59652530c84d3710e6526c0647152fad56b3b.jpg"},{"name":"Researcher VoiceData Finish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1884140/758257a244f2fb97f87fafa2cf163a83b69e2da2.jpg"},{"name":"Sekptic VoiceData On","path":"https://cdn.akam